{"n":101,"verses":[{"v":1,"en":"The Striking Calamity","bn":"করাঘাতকারী","w":[["ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","The Striking Calamity","al-qāriʿatu",1400]]},{"v":2,"en":"What is the Striking Calamity","bn":"করাঘাতকারী কি","w":[["مَا","What","mā",2],["ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","(is) the Striking Calamity","l-qāriʿatu",1400]]},{"v":3,"en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity","bn":"করাঘাতকারী সম্পর্কে আপনি কি জানেন","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā",2],["أَدۡرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka",571],["مَا","what","mā",2],["ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","(is) the Striking Calamity","l-qāriʿatu",1400]]},{"v":4,"en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed","bn":"যেদিন মানুষ হবে বিক্ষিপ্ত পতংগের মত","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(The) Day","yawma",21],["يَكُونُ","will be","yakūnu",9],["ٱلنَّاسُ","the mankind","l-nāsu",50],["كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ","like moths","kal-farāshi",4745],["ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ","scattered","l-mabthūthi",4746]]},{"v":5,"en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up","bn":"এবং পর্বতমালা হবে ধুনিত রঙ্গীন পশমের মত।","w":[["وَتَكُونُ","And will be","watakūnu",9],["ٱلۡجِبَالُ","the mountains","l-jibālu",296],["كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ","like wool","kal-ʿih'ni",2786],["ٱلۡمَنفُوشِ","fluffed up","l-manfūshi",4747]]},{"v":6,"en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds]","bn":"অতএব যার পাল্লা ভারী হবে","w":[["فَأَمَّا","Then as for","fa-ammā",210],["مَن","(him) whose","man",14],["ثَقُلَتۡ","(are) heavy","thaqulat",1558],["مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","his scales","mawāzīnuhu",597]]},{"v":7,"en":"He will be in a pleasant life","bn":"সে সুখীজীবন যাপন করবে।","w":[["فَهُوَ","Then he","fahuwa",10],["فِي","(will be) in","fī",3],["عِيشَةٖ","a life","ʿīshatin",2782],["رَّاضِيَةٖ","pleasant","rāḍiyatin",1682]]},{"v":8,"en":"But as for one whose scales are light","bn":"আর যার পাল্লা হালকা হবে","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for","wa-ammā",210],["مَنۡ","(him) whose","man",14],["خَفَّتۡ","(are) light","khaffat",1867],["مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","his scales","mawāzīnuhu",597]]},{"v":9,"en":"His refuge will be an abyss","bn":"তার ঠিকানা হবে হাবিয়া।","w":[["فَأُمُّهُۥ","His abode","fa-ummuhu",330],["هَاوِيَةࣱ","(will be the) Pit","hāwiyatun",4748]]},{"v":10,"en":"And what can make you know what that is","bn":"আপনি জানেন তা কি","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā",2],["أَدۡرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka",571],["مَا","what","mā",2],["هِيَهۡ","it is","hiyah",58]]},{"v":11,"en":"It is a Fire, intensely hot","bn":"প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি","w":[["نَارٌ","A Fire","nārun",80],["حَامِيَةُۢ","intensely hot","ḥāmiyatun",2810]]}]}